  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nThis is “<b>Nun of Your Business</b>” – An action-packed battlefield where anime-styled warrior nuns cleanse the world of demonic corruption!<p></p>\n<p><b>When sacred vows meet unholy war… prepare for divine retribution.</b></p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Choose Your Character – Select from a powerful roster of anime-styled nuns. From a nun to an angelic looking warrior. Unlock and master unique holy warriors. Defeat the unholy monsters from Hell.\n</li><li>Fight the Unholy – Battle grotesque demons, skeletal hordes, and corrupted abominations that crawl from the deepest pits of hell. Slay waves of twisted monsters born from darkness. Adapt to varied enemy attack patterns and unholy tricks. Purge arenas filled with hellish threats and escalating challenges.\n</li><li>Epic Boss Fights – Face off against monstrous bosses in intense encounters that will test your aim, timing, and divine wrath. Engage in cinematic battles against towering horrors. Learn and counter deadly boss mechanics and phases. Unleash ultimate skills to deliver divine judgment.\n</li></ul>\n",
